---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    This static scaffold has no message input, analytics, remote fonts or
    message-processing API. Static asset requests can appear in the host's
    ordinary access logs.
  </p>
  <p>
    The planned sender keeps message state in tab memory. Explicit downloads,
    clipboard copies and printing persist outside the application; their storage
    cannot be securely erased by the website.
  </p>
</Layout>
